  "thag1.77:0.3": "",
  "thag1.77:0.4": "1. 8. 7. piyañjahattheragāthā. ",
  "thag1.77:1.1": "idaṃ pure cittamacāri cārikaṃ ",
  "thag1.77:1.2": "yenicchakaṃ yatthakāmaṃ yathāsukhaṃ ",
  "thag1.77:1.3": "tadajjahaṃ niggahessāmi yoniso ",
  "thag1.77:1.4": "hatthippabhinnaṃ viya aṅkusaggaho’ti. itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā ",
  "thag1.77:1.5": "hatthārohaputto thero gāthaṃ abhāsitthā’ti. "
}
